{"title": "Sources of Temporary Hit Points", "pageid": 26674, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sources_of_Temporary_Hit_Points", "categories": ["Lists", "Lists of sources"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">Temporary Hit Points</a> can be obtained from a variety of sources. This page provides sources of temporary hit points <b>that are available to player characters</b>.\n</p><p>In many cases, having temporary hit points from a source provides additional benefits. Additional sources of temporary hit points can prolong these beneficial effects provided they do not add more temporary hit points than were granted by the original source.\n</p>\n\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Spells\">Spells</span></h1>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Agathys\" title=\"Armour of Agathys\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp/25px-Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp/38px-Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp/50px-Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour of Agathys\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp/25px-Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/77/Armour_of_Agathys_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Agathys\" title=\"Armour of Agathys\">Armour of Agathys</a> (<i><b>5 per spell level</b></i>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bear%27s_Endurance\" title=\"Bear's Endurance\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Bear%27s_Endurance_Icon.webp/25px-Bear%27s_Endurance_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Bear%27s_Endurance_Icon.webp/38px-Bear%27s_Endurance_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Bear%27s_Endurance_Icon.webp/50px-Bear%27s_Endurance_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bear's Endurance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Bear%27s_Endurance_Icon.webp/25px-Bear%27s_Endurance_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Bear%27s_Endurance_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bear%27s_Endurance\" title=\"Bear's Endurance\">Bear's Endurance</a> (<i><b>7</b></i>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/False_Life\" title=\"False Life\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/False_Life_Icon.webp/25px-False_Life_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/False_Life_Icon.webp/38px-False_Life_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/False_Life_Icon.webp/50px-False_Life_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"False Life\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/False_Life_Icon.webp/25px-False_Life_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/False_Life_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/False_Life\" title=\"False Life\">False Life</a> (<i><b>7 plus 5 per additional spell level</b></i>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heroism\" title=\"Heroism\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Heroism_Icon.webp/25px-Heroism_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Heroism_Icon.webp/38px-Heroism_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Heroism_Icon.webp/50px-Heroism_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heroism\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Heroism_Icon.webp/25px-Heroism_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/19/Heroism_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heroism\" title=\"Heroism\">Heroism</a> (<i><b>5 per turn</b></i>)</li></ul>\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Equipment\">Equipment</span></h1>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Headwear\">Headwear</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helmet_of_Smiting\" title=\"Helmet of Smiting\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/93/Metal_Helmet_Magical_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Metal_Helmet_Magical_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/93/Metal_Helmet_Magical_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Metal_Helmet_Magical_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/93/Metal_Helmet_Magical_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Metal_Helmet_Magical_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/93/Metal_Helmet_Magical_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Metal_Helmet_Magical_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/93/Metal_Helmet_Magical_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Helmet_of_Smiting\" title=\"Helmet of Smiting\">Helmet of Smiting</a> (<i><b>Charisma modifier</b>: Upon applying a condition with a smite spell</i>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Lifebringer\" title=\"The Lifebringer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/The_Lifebringer_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-The_Lifebringer_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/The_Lifebringer_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-The_Lifebringer_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/The_Lifebringer_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-The_Lifebringer_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/The_Lifebringer_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-The_Lifebringer_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/The_Lifebringer_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Lifebringer\" title=\"The Lifebringer\">The Lifebringer</a> (<i><b>3</b>: Upon gaining lightning charges</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Cloaks\">Cloaks</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vivacious_Cloak\" title=\"Vivacious Cloak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Vivacious_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Vivacious_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Vivacious_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Vivacious_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Vivacious_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Vivacious_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Vivacious_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Vivacious_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Vivacious_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vivacious_Cloak\" title=\"Vivacious Cloak\">Vivacious Cloak</a> (<i><b>8</b>: Upon casting a spell in melee</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Armour\">Armour</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Moonbasking\" title=\"Armour of Moonbasking\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Moonbasking\" title=\"Armour of Moonbasking\">Armour of Moonbasking</a> (<i><b>22</b>: After casting <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\">Wild Shape</a></i>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blazer_of_Benevolence\" title=\"Blazer of Benevolence\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Blazer_of_Benevolence_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Blazer_of_Benevolence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Blazer_of_Benevolence_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Blazer_of_Benevolence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Blazer_of_Benevolence_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Blazer_of_Benevolence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Blazer_of_Benevolence_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Blazer_of_Benevolence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/Blazer_of_Benevolence_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blazer_of_Benevolence\" title=\"Blazer of Benevolence\">Blazer of Benevolence</a> (<i><b>4</b>: Upon inspiring an ally with <a href=\"/wiki/Bardic_Inspiration_(class_action)\" title=\"Bardic Inspiration (class action)\">Bardic Inspiration</a></i>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bonespike_Garb\" title=\"Bonespike Garb\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Bonespike_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Bonespike_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Bonespike_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Bonespike_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Bonespike_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Bonespike_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Bonespike_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Bonespike_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/Bonespike_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bonespike_Garb\" title=\"Bonespike Garb\">Bonespike Garb</a> (<i><b>15</b>: Upon activating rage</i>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Drunken_Cloth\" title=\"Drunken Cloth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Drunken_Cloth\" title=\"Drunken Cloth\">Drunken Cloth</a> (<i><b>Constitution modifier</b>: At the start of each turn while <a href=\"/wiki/Drunk\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Drunk\">Drunk</a></i>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Icebite_Robe\" title=\"Icebite Robe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1a/Icebite_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Icebite_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1a/Icebite_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Icebite_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1a/Icebite_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Icebite_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1a/Icebite_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Icebite_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1a/Icebite_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Icebite_Robe\" title=\"Icebite Robe\">Icebite Robe</a> (<i><b>15</b>: Provides access to 3rd level <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Agathys\" title=\"Armour of Agathys\">Armour of Agathys</a></i>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potent_Robe\" title=\"Potent Robe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Potent_Robe\" title=\"Potent Robe\">Potent Robe</a> (<i><b>Charisma modifier:</b> At the beginning of each turn</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gloves\">Gloves</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reason%27s_Grasp\" title=\"Reason's Grasp\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Reasons_Grasp_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Reasons_Grasp_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Reasons_Grasp_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Reasons_Grasp_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Reasons_Grasp_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Reasons_Grasp_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Reasons_Grasp_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Reasons_Grasp_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0f/Reasons_Grasp_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Reason%27s_Grasp\" title=\"Reason's Grasp\">Reason's Grasp</a> (<i><b>15</b>: After wearer chooses to end their <a href=\"/wiki/Rage_(Condition)\" title=\"Rage (Condition)\">Rage</a></i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Boots\">Boots</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemic